- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/BuildOwner.java` — line 16 stores the adjusted date: `owner.setRegistrationDate(BusinessDays.effectiveRegistrationDate(owner.getRegistrationDate()))`.
