The test base (`AcceptanceBase.toBusinessDay`) and the `AcceptanceTest` doc comment both describe the roll as skipping **weekends AND public holidays**. However, the production `BusinessDays.rollToBusinessDay` skips **weekends only** — it has no holiday handling and no holiday list of its own. So the production code does not currently implement the holiday-skipping the tests/comments imply. The only holiday list in the codebase is the test-side `HOLIDAYS` set (hardcoded to 2026 dates).

